1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:02,300
Oj, oj! Bullen trillar!

2
00:00:02,300 --> 00:00:02,900
(Åh nej!)

3
00:00:02,900 --> 00:00:03,900
Rull, rull –

4
00:00:03,900 --> 00:00:05,100
nerför backen,

5
00:00:05,100 --> 00:00:06,200
bort, bort …

6
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:07,700
Björnen är ledsen –

7
00:00:07,700 --> 00:00:09,000
snyft, snyft.

8
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:13,000
Vem kan hjälpa? (Vem kan hjälpa?)

9
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:15,200
Igelkotten! (Igelkotten!)

10
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:16,600
Rullar ihop sig –

11
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:18,100
stopp!

12
00:00:18,100 --> 00:00:19,300
Bullen stannar –

13
00:00:19,300 --> 00:00:20,200
tack, tack!

14
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:23,000
En bit var – till alla tre!

15
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:24,200
Mums, mums –

16
00:00:24,200 --> 00:00:25,100
hurra!

